message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "The Living Daylights: SNIPER'S NEST — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic PROJECT BOND film package modeling The Living Daylights
  (1987): sniper ballistics (rifle zero, windage, rules of engagement, the
  cello case), staged risk-scored defection handling, and mountain/desert
  terrain operations. Implements the frozen BOND-API MissionProvider protocol.
authors:
